  - Description: Diagnostic tests provide information used for tumor staging in prostate cancer
  - Source: ADVANCED-STAGE PROSTATE CANCER
  - Target: TUMOR STAGING
  - Description: Tumor staging identifies whether prostate cancer has reached the advanced stage
  - Source: TUMOR TESTING
  - Target: TUMOR STAGING
  - Description: Tumor testing helps determine the likelihood of cancer spread and aggressive transformation, which can inform tumor staging</data>
