      <data key="d2">endpoint</data>
      <data key="d3">Laboratory analysis of a biopsy sample by a neuropathologist, including histologic and molecular testing, to diagnose whether a tumor is malignant or benign and to identify its type and grade.
Relationships: (None provided in the data)</data>
    </node>
