      <data key="d3">Oropharyngeal cancer, also called throat (oropharyngeal) cancer, is a cancer of the oropharynx, the middle part of the throat near the mouth. It is classified as a head and neck cancer. The National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) provides patient guidelines and patient information for this condition.
