  - Source: HEAD AND NECK CANCER
  - Target: LARYNGEAL CANCER
  - Description: Laryngeal cancer is a type of head and neck cancer, arising in the larynx/voice box
  - Source: NASOPHARYNGEAL CANCER
  - Target: LARYNGEAL CANCER
  - Description: Nasopharyngeal cancer should not be confused with laryngeal cancer, another type of cancer affecting the throat
