      <data key="d2">endpoint</data>
      <data key="d3">Infectious mononucleosis is a common viral disease caused by Epstein-Barr virus that remains dormant or inactive in most people.
Relationships:
  - Source: INFECTIOUS MONONUCLEOSIS
  - Target: EBV-RELATED CANCER
  - Description: Infectious mononucleosis and EBV-related cancer are both caused by the Epstein-Barr virus, though the text does not say one causes the other.</data>
    </node>
