      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">: This blood test measures substances in the blood to provide information about kidney and liver function. It is used to assess overall metabolic health and can help detect conditions that may affect cardiovascular health, such as electrolyte imbalances [Data: Entities (251); Relationships (996, 997, 998, 511)].
</data>
    </node>
