      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3">Cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma of the vermilion lip is a squamous cell carcinoma occurring at the area where the skin and the lip meet on the outside of the mouth. It is not included in the mouth cancer book but is covered in NCCN Guidelines for Patients: Squamous Cell Skin Cancer.
