  - Source: SQUAMOUS CELL CARCINOMA
  - Target: CUTANEOUS SQUAMOUS CELL CARCINOMA OF THE VERMILION LIP
  - Description: Cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma of the vermilion lip is a form of squamous cell carcinoma and is described as not included in the mouth cancer book.
  - Source: CUTANEOUS SQUAMOUS CELL CARCINOMA OF THE VERMILION LIP
  - Target: SQUAMOUS CELL SKIN CANCER
  - Description: Cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma of the vermilion lip is a form of squamous cell skin cancer.
  - Source: NCCN
  - Target: CUTANEOUS SQUAMOUS CELL CARCINOMA OF THE VERMILION LIP
  - Description: The NCCN Guidelines for Patients: Squamous Cell Skin Cancer at NCCN.org provides treatment information for cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma of the vermilion lip.
  - Source: CUTANEOUS SQUAMOUS CELL CARCINOMA OF THE VERMILION LIP
  - Target: CANCER
  - Description: Cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma of the vermilion lip is a type of cancer.
  - Source: MOUTH CANCER
  - Target: CUTANEOUS SQUAMOUS CELL CARCINOMA OF THE VERMILION LIP
  - Description: Cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma of the vermilion lip is explicitly excluded from the mouth cancer book, distinguishing it from cancers of the mucosal lip and oral cavity.</data>
