  - Source: TRANSURETHRAL RESECTION OF BLADDER TUMOR (TURBT)
  - Target: BLADDER REMOVAL SURGERY
  - Description: TURBT and bladder removal surgery are both surgical procedures used to treat bladder cancer.</data>
