      <data key="d3">Platinum-based chemotherapy is a specific chemotherapy regimen commonly recommended for use in conjunction with radiation therapy, particularly when systemic therapy is planned as part of the treatment strategy. It is also utilized as a systemic therapy for metastatic cervical cancer, often administered as a combination regimen to enhance therapeutic effectiveness.
