    <node id="MODIFIED RADICAL HYSTERECTOMY">
      <data key="d0">MODIFIED RADICAL HYSTERECTOMY</data>
      <data key="d1">MODIFIED RADICAL HYSTERECTOMY</data>
      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3">Modified radical hysterectomy is a surgical procedure performed through the abdomen that involves the removal of the uterus, cervix, the parametrial tissue (the connective tissue that holds the cervix in place), and up to approximately half an inch of the upper vagina. In addition to these resections, the procedure includes lymph node evaluation, making it distinct from a simple hysterectomy. This approach is typically used for certain gynecologic cancers, as it addresses both the primary tumor and potential regional spread through lymphatic assessment.
Relationships:
  - Source: CERVICAL CANCER
  - Target: MODIFIED RADICAL HYSTERECTOMY
  - Description: Modified radical hysterectomy is a type of hysterectomy used to treat cervical cancer
  - Source: MODIFIED RADICAL HYSTERECTOMY
  - Target: PELVIC LYMPH NODE EVALUATION
  - Description: Pelvic lymph node evaluation is performed with modified radical hysterectomy</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">ENTITY: MODIFIED RADICAL HYSTERECTOMY
Description: Modified radical hysterectomy is a surgical procedure performed through the abdomen that involves the removal of the uterus, cervix, the parametrial tissue (the connective tissue that holds the cervix in place), and up to approximately half an inch of the upper vagina. In addition to these resections, the procedure includes lymph node evaluation, making it distinct from a simple hysterectomy. This approach is typically used for certain gynecologic cancers, as it addresses both the primary tumor and potential regional spread through lymphatic assessment.
Relationships:
  - Source: CERVICAL CANCER
  - Target: MODIFIED RADICAL HYSTERECTOMY
  - Description: Modified radical hysterectomy is a type of hysterectomy used to treat cervical cancer
  - Source: MODIFIED RADICAL HYSTERECTOMY
  - Target: PELVIC LYMPH NODE EVALUATION
  - Description: Pelvic lymph node evaluation is performed with modified radical hysterectomy</data>
