    <node id="PROGNOSTIC CONSIDERATIONS: THE DIAGNOSTIC PROCESS ALSO INFORMS DISCUSSIONS ABOUT PROGNOSIS. WHILE CURE IS RARE, IT MAY BE POSSIBLE IF THE DISEASE IS DIAGNOSED EARLY AND TREATED IMMEDIATELY, PARTICULARLY IN YOUNGER, HEALTHIER PATIENTS. EVEN WHEN CURE IS NOT POSSIBLE, TREATMENT CAN SLOW GROWTH, REDUCE SYMPTOMS, AND PROLONG LIFE [DATA: ENTITIES (1071); RELATIONSHIPS (2725, 2717); SOURCES (187)].">
