  - Description: This regimen is recommended for use with radiation therapy
  - Source: ANAL CANCER
  - Target: MITOMYCIN AND 5-FU
  - Description: This regimen is recommended for use with radiation therapy to treat stage I, II, and III anal cancer
  - Source: CHEMORADIATION
  - Target: MITOMYCIN AND 5-FU
  - Description: This regimen is one of the chemotherapy regimens used as part of chemoradiation</data>
