      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3">IMAGING encompasses various techniques used to visualize internal structures and detect disease. Among these, PET/CT is a more advanced imaging test that may be needed to detect cancer spread farther than lymph nodes. PET/CT is an imaging test that combines positron emission tomography (PET) with computed tomography (CT), allowing for both functional and anatomical assessment in a single procedure.</data>
