    <node id="INTRAVESICAL BCG">
      <data key="d0">INTRAVESICAL BCG</data>
      <data key="d1">INTRAVESICAL BCG</data>
      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3">Intravesical BCG is an intravesical therapy that uses a weak bacterium to trigger the immune system to attack bladder cancer cells; it is given after TURBT and can be continued as maintenance therapy.
