  - Description: Intravesical BCG is usually started 3 to 6 weeks after TURBT and may be continued as maintenance after TURBT.
  - Source: INTRAVESICAL BCG
  - Target: MAINTENANCE THERAPY
  - Description: Maintenance therapy consists of additional intravesical BCG treatments to prevent bladder cancer recurrence.</data>
