    <node id="ENDOCRINE TESTS">
      <data key="d0">ENDOCRINE TESTS</data>
      <data key="d1">ENDOCRINE TESTS</data>
      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3">Endocrine tests are blood tests used to evaluate hormone glands, particularly the thyroid and pituitary. These tests are commonly performed before and/or after radiation therapy to the head and neck, as such treatment can affect endocrine function. By checking thyroid and other hormone levels, endocrine tests help assess and monitor the impact of radiation on these glands.
Relationships:
  - Source: TREATMENT
  - Target: ENDOCRINE TESTS
  - Description: Cancer treatment may affect endocrine glands, so endocrine blood tests may be done before and/or after treatment.
  - Source: ENDOCRINE TESTS
  - Target: RADIATION THERAPY
  - Description: Radiation therapy to the head and neck can affect the endocrine glands, so endocrine tests may be needed to monitor endocrine function. These endocrine blood tests might be performed before and/or after radiation treatment to assess and manage any potential impact on the glands.
  - Source: HEAD AND NECK CANCER
  - Target: ENDOCRINE TESTS
  - Description: Radiation therapy to head and neck cancer can affect endocrine glands, so blood tests may be done before and/or after treatment.

---</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">ENTITY: ENDOCRINE TESTS
Description: Endocrine tests are blood tests used to evaluate hormone glands, particularly the thyroid and pituitary. These tests are commonly performed before and/or after radiation therapy to the head and neck, as such treatment can affect endocrine function. By checking thyroid and other hormone levels, endocrine tests help assess and monitor the impact of radiation on these glands.
Relationships:
  - Source: TREATMENT
  - Target: ENDOCRINE TESTS
  - Description: Cancer treatment may affect endocrine glands, so endocrine blood tests may be done before and/or after treatment.
  - Source: ENDOCRINE TESTS
  - Target: RADIATION THERAPY
  - Description: Radiation therapy to the head and neck can affect the endocrine glands, so endocrine tests may be needed to monitor endocrine function. These endocrine blood tests might be performed before and/or after radiation treatment to assess and manage any potential impact on the glands.
  - Source: HEAD AND NECK CANCER
  - Target: ENDOCRINE TESTS
  - Description: Radiation therapy to head and neck cancer can affect endocrine glands, so blood tests may be done before and/or after treatment.

---</data>
    </node>
