      <data key="d11">The neurosurgeon is a specialist who performs surgical biopsy procedures, including stereotactic biopsy and resection, to obtain tissue samples for diagnostic evaluation. These biopsy procedures are conducted in the operating room, ensuring a controlled and sterile environment for the patient.</data>
