      <data key="d8">PATHOLOGIC STAGING</data>
      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">Clinical and pathologic staging are two related time points in cancer staging; clinical is before treatment, pathologic is determined after surgery.</data>
      <data key="d12">CLINICAL STAGING</data>
    </edge>
