      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">Blast phase CML is an advanced form of CML, and the type of blast cells in BP-CML affects treatment.</data>
      <data key="d12">CHRONIC MYELOID LEUKEMIA</data>
    </edge>
