      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">Ultrasound is an imaging technique that can be used to guide a biopsy procedure, helping clinicians target the correct area for tissue sampling. It is commonly utilized to guide biopsies of the prostate, and may also be used to guide biopsies in other clinical contexts.</data>
