      <data key="d8">TUMOR REMOVAL</data>
      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">If a tumor is found during cystoscopy, it must be removed in an operating room; very small growths can be removed during cystoscopy</data>
